Aim: Achieve multiple inheritance using two interfaces.

Algorithm: Start
declare two interfaces
implement both
call methods
stop.

Program:

interface A { void first(); }
interface B { void second(); }
class Demo implements A, B {
    public void first(){System.out.println("Interface A");}
    public void second(){System.out.println("Interface B");}
}
class MultipleInterface {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Demo d=new Demo(); d.first(); d.second();
    }
}

Result: Interface A and Interface B

